OL,3,AThames Water rescue deal should be
OL,4,Arejected - MPs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cross-party committee of MPs has
OL,7,Furged the government to reject a #10bn
OL,8,Ftakeover proposal from Thames Water's
OL,9,Fcreditors.
OL,11,FThe UK's biggest water company owes
OL,12,Froughly #20bn and has been working with
OL,13,Fcreditors and government officials.
OL,15,FA report by the Environment, Food and
OL,16,FRural Affairs (EFRA) Committee has now
OL,17,Fsaid the government should consider
OL,18,Fplacing it into special administration,
OL,19,Fa form of temporary nationalisation.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
